# Workflow docs lifecycle

Active work tracking mirrors kame-homes:

| Folder | Purpose |
| ------ | ------- |
| `docs/workflow/intake/` | Raw ideas, scratchpads (`*-design.md`) |
| `docs/workflow/planned/` | Approved plans (`<slug>.md` + `README.md` index) |
| `docs/workflow/in-progress/` | Current execution docs |
| `docs/workflow/done/` | Shipped — archive summary |
| `docs/workflow/wont-do/` | Explicitly declined |

**No silent moves** — update index tables when status changes. Skills: `workflow`, `workflow-intake-scratchpads`.

Commands: `/workflow-start`, `/workflow-done`, `/workflow-wont-do`, `/workflow-sync-scratchpads`.
